{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"options\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": \"欢喜越发浓烈，渴望也变得直接，他更愿意沉浸在亲近里。尝过依赖中的片刻自在后，他对更深的投入多了一分信任。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他开始愿意让亲近中的自在发展为更深的情感投入。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 8,\n      \"why\": \"前文的短暂自在为更深的投入提供了切实经验，因此能解释这一次为何从享受亲近走向更热烈的投入。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选3\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": \"欢喜里渐渐有了急着靠近的劲头，他想把两人之间的距离再缩短。那份安慰已成依靠，于是他开始相信，更深的靠近能让这份安稳延续。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他开始相信，更深的靠近能让这份安稳延续。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 7,\n      \"why\": \"前文已把亲近和安稳联系起来，因此靠近的急切有历史依据；但把更深的靠近视为延续安稳的途径，仍比已确立的经历多了一步推断。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选12\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "19719121-e660-4e64-9230-95b416d80445", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T021003358067Z", "elapsed_seconds": 74.016, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T02:11:17.392082+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9810b4f64a20a02ab57aa06c305126a4b7f9857a99d2357bd0c6f7693019da8e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec0663976702